<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1115 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1115 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility cow carcasses mostly steady. Demand and offerings light to moderate, USDA said.</p>
<p>    COW &amp; BULL CARCASS FOB OMAHA	4.0   Loads Reported.</p>
<p>			  Lds   Price Range    Latest Estb. Mkt.</p>
<p>UT,brk 2-4 450#/up  2.0   67.00 - 68.00     67.00 - 68.00</p>
<p>UT,bng 1-3 400#/up  2.0   71.00 - 72.00     71.00 - 72.00</p>
<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up				    unq</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up				    unq</p>
<p>Boneless processing beef not established early. Demand light for light to moderate offerings, USDA said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
